<div class="ws-container">
<div class="ws-m-block-title-770">
<ws-text data-alignment="center" slot="block-title"><h2>Naši paketi u ponudi</h2><h5>Ovo su paketi kod kojih je u cenu uračunata voda, renta aparata i usluga isporuke u skladu sa uslovima uz ugovornu obavezu od 12 meseci.</h5></ws-text>
</div>
<div class="ws-m-service" data-surface="1">
<ws-columns layout="3-columns" slot="block-columns">
<ws-column class="col-10 col-sm-8 col-md-6 col-lg-4 max-sm:col-[10/12] max-md:col-[8/12] max-lg:col-[6/12] col-[4/12]">
<article>
<ws-media-container aspect-ratio="1.178" content-position="50% 50%" content-scale="1" style="aspect-ratio: 1.178">
<picture>
<source sizes="(max-width: 575px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 67vw, (max-width: 991px) 50vw, (max-width: 1199px) 33vw, 400px" srcset="/ws/alt-imgs/w400/ccecf60a2d45e06de3cdd4aaf74c0fc9.webp 400w, /ws/alt-imgs/w600/ccecf60a2d45e06de3cdd4aaf74c0fc9.webp 600w, /ws/alt-imgs/w800/ccecf60a2d45e06de3cdd4aaf74c0fc9.webp 800w, /ws/alt-imgs/w1200/ccecf60a2d45e06de3cdd4aaf74c0fc9.webp 1200w, /ws/alt-imgs/orig/ccecf60a2d45e06de3cdd4aaf74c0fc9.webp 1254w" type="image/webp"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/ws/media-library/ccecf60a2d45e06de3cdd4aaf74c0fc9/7687a495-9698-4c08-872b-f90e79c0a045.png"/>
</picture>
</ws-media-container>
<ws-text><h4><b class="ws-bold">Mini </b>paket</h4><ul style="text-align: left;"><li><p><b class="ws-bold"><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643)">2 boce</ws-color></b><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643)"> od 18,9l mesečno</ws-color></p></li><li><p><b class="ws-bold"><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);">kompresorski </ws-color></b><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);">aparat</ws-color></p></li><li><p><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);">uračunata dostava​ do II sprata bez lifta</ws-color></p></li><li><p><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);">cena za litar </ws-color><b class="ws-bold"><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);">57,67RSD</ws-color></b></p></li><li><p><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);">uz prvu isporuku dodatna boca gratis</ws-color></p></li><li><p><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);">prvo plaćanje sa uračunatom kaucijom za boce </ws-color><b class="ws-bold"><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);">4340RSD</ws-color></b></p></li><li><p><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);">dodatna potrošnja po boci </ws-color><b class="ws-bold"><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);">790RSD</ws-color></b><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);"> (41,80/lit.)</ws-color></p></li></ul><p class="text-[44px]/[60px] max-xl:auto:text-[42px]/[58px] max-md:auto:text-[35px]/[50px]" style="text-align: center;"><b class="ws-bold"><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783670141377-1783670141373)">2180RSD</ws-color></b></p></ws-text>
</article>
