</picture>
</ws-media-container>
<ws-text><h4><b class="ws-bold">Maxi </b>paket</h4><ul style="text-align: left;"><li><p><b class="ws-bold"><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643)">6 boca</ws-color></b><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643)"> od 18,9l mesečno</ws-color></p></li><li><p><b class="ws-bold"><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);">kompresorski</ws-color></b><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);"> </ws-color><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);">aparat</ws-color></p></li><li><p><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);">uračunata dostava​ do II sprata bez lifta​</ws-color></p></li><li><p><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);">cena za litar </ws-color><b class="ws-bold"><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);">44,00RSD</ws-color></b></p></li><li><p><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);">uz prvu isporuku dodatna boca gratis</ws-color></p></li><li><p><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);">prvo plaćanje sa uračunatom kaucijom za boce </ws-color><b class="ws-bold"><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);">10030RSD</ws-color></b></p></li><li><p><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);">dodatna potrošnja po boci </ws-color><b class="ws-bold"><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);">790RSD</ws-color></b><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783704193643-1783704193643);"> (41,80/lit.)</ws-color></p></li></ul><p class="text-[44px]/[60px] max-xl:auto:text-[42px]/[58px] max-md:auto:text-[35px]/[50px]" style="text-align: center;"><b class="ws-bold"><ws-color class="ws-custom-color" style="color: var(--text-color-1783670119232-1783670119230)">4990RSD</ws-color></b></p></ws-text>
</article>
</ws-column>
</ws-columns>
</div>
<div class="ws-m-button-group ws-m-button-group--center">
<ws-button-group data-alignment="center" slot="button-group">
</ws-button-group>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</ws-block><ws-block border-bottom="" border-width="1" category="why choose us" data-ws-variation-id="features-with-counters-ai-why-choose-us-4cols" id="ws-block-features-with-counters-MkbvlZ91" src="/ws/block-templates/features-with-counters/index.html" surfaces="ws-light-0" white-space-bottom="120" white-space-top="120"><section class="ws-section ws-surface ws-light-0" data-surface="0" data-ws-hidden-children="primary_button secondary_button" data-ws-slots="block-title block-columns button-group">
<div class="ws-container">
<div class="ws-m-block-title-770">
<ws-text slot="block-title">
<h2>Zašto odabrati nas?</h2>
<h5>Izaberite nas za vrhunski kvalitet i uslugu u oblasti snabdevanja vodom za piće.</h5>
</ws-text>
</div>
<div class="ws-m-feature-with-counter" data-surface="1">
<ws-columns layout="4-columns" slot="block-columns">
<ws-column class="max-sm:col-[10/12] max-md:col-[8/12] max-lg:col-[6/12] col-[3/12]">
<article>
<ws-text>
<h4>Kvalitetna voda</h4>
<p>Nudimo prirodnu izvorsku vodu Vlasina, istog kvaliteta kao na izvodu i sa najmanje suvog ostatka na našem tržištu.</p>
</ws-text>
</article>
</ws-column>
<ws-column class="max-sm:col-[10/12] max-md:col-[8/12] max-lg:col-[6/12] col-[3/12]">
<article>
<ws-text>
<h4>Fleksibilna rešenja</h4>
<p>Prodaja i iznajmljivanje aparata prilagođeno potrebama kupaca, bilo da su u pitanju domaćinstva ili firme.</p>
</ws-text>
</article>
</ws-column>
<ws-column class="max-sm:col-[10/12] max-md:col-[8/12] max-lg:col-[6/12] col-[3/12]">
<article>
<ws-text>
<h4>Brza dostava</h4>
<p>Redovna dostava vode u povratnim bocama, brzo i efikasno.</p>
</ws-text>
</article>
</ws-column>
<ws-column class="max-sm:col-[10/12] max-md:col-[8/12] max-lg:col-[6/12] col-[3/12]">
<article>
<ws-text>
<h4>Stručan tim</h4>
<p>Naš tim pruža vrhunsku podršku i servisiranje aparata.</p>
</ws-text>
</article>
</ws-column>
</ws-columns>
</div>
<div class="ws-m-button-group ws-m-button-group--center">
<ws-button-group slot="button-group">
</ws-button-group>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</ws-block><ws-block border-width="1" category="contacts" content-alignment="middle" content-direction="normal" data-ws-id="ref_242" data-ws-variation-id="contacts-splitscreen-with-iframe-ai" id="ws-block-contacts-splitscreen-with-iframe-Xzw3YDMG" media-column-width="5" src="/ws/block-templates/contacts-splitscreen-with-iframe/index.html" surfaces="ws-custom-dark-ztkgxggscq" user-modified="white-space-top,white-space-bottom" white-space-bottom="32" white-space-top="32"><section class="ws-section ws-surface ws-custom-dark-ztkgxggscq" data-surface="0" data-ws-slots="block-title business-address business-phone business-email business-hours business-social-profiles block-media">
<div class="ws-m-split-layout">
<div class="ws-m-split-layout__content ws-block-content">
<div class="ws-m-block-title-fit-wrapper">
<div class="ws-m-block-title-570">
<ws-text slot="block-title">
<h2>Kontaktirajte nas</h2>
<h5>Za sve informacije, slobodno nas kontaktirajte putem telefona ili e-maila.</h5>
</ws-text>
</div>
<div class="ws-m-business-info ws-m-business-info--with-icon">
<ws-global slot="business-address" src="/ws/globals/addresses/index.html"><address>
<p>Novoseljanski put 44b, Pančevo</p>
</address></ws-global>
